The legal text is Law No. 63 of 2015 of the State of Kuwait as published by the Ministry of Justice of Kuwait, https://www.moj.gov.kw/AR/Pages/MojLaws.aspx, retrieved 29 October 2026. The ministry states no licence; official legislation, credited to the Ministry of Justice.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text layer of the PDF was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph or item per line; spacing and punctuation were normalised, digit runs stored in visual order were restored, kashida was removed, and the recitals and explanatory memorandum were left out. The wording of the law was not changed.

